  "description": "WebForms Core is a command-driven, server-oriented web technology that enables\ndirect and deterministic control of the HTML DOM from the server without page\nreloads or modern front-end frameworks. Built on a Commander–Executor\narchitecture, the server issues explicit UI commands while the client acts as a\npure executor. WebForms Core is stateless on the server, framework-agnostic on\nthe backend, compliant with HTML standards, and capable of operating online,\noffline, or even without a server. It supports event-driven HTML, real DOM\nmanipulation (without Virtual DOM), and multiple communication models including\nHTTP, AJAX, SSE, and WebSockets.",
